    "title": "Football Quiz! Ultimate Trivia",
    "description": "Welcome to Football Quiz! Ultimate Trivia, the ultimate free football guessing quiz trivia game in the world!\r\n\r\nWith hundreds of levels and thousands of players to guess, this game is guaranteed to keep you entertained for hours on end. The best part? It's completely free to play!\r\n\r\nDownload now and join to our millions of players around the world that already get addicted!\r\n\r\nAs you progress through Football Quiz! Ultimate Trivia, you'll unlock new levels and challenges that will put your brain knowledge to the test. In 2023, the game is expected to have an even larger index of images to guess from: players, legends, teams, coaches and competitions from all over the world\r\nThis game is highly addictive and challenging, with new levels and players being added regularly to keep you on your toes. Test your knowledge of the football world and see if you have what it takes to become a true football quiz trivia master.\r\n\r\nIf you think you're up for an even bigger challenge, invite your friends and family to play with you and see who can guess the most playesr correctly. Football Quiz! Ultimate Trivia is the perfect game for a group outing or for passing the time with your loved ones. \r\n\r\nBut the fun doesn't stop there - this game also has tons of amazing features to keep you engaged and coming back for more:\r\n\r\n\u2605 Easy to play - just type the word you think is in the picture to make your guess.\r\n\u2605 High-quality players images that are challenging but not impossible to guess.\r\n\u2605 Hints - stuck on a level? Use a hint to get a clue and keep the game moving.\r\n\u2605 In-game currency - use coins to purchase hints, lives or unlock special levels.\r\n\u2605 Offline play - no internet? no problem. This game can be played offline.\r\n\u2605 A wide range of difficulty levels, from beginner to expert, to appeal to players of all skill levels.\r\n\u2605 Detailed stats: Track your progress and see how you compare to other players.\r\n\u2605 Multiple lives: Use multiple lives to keep playing even if you make a wrong guess.\r\n\u2605 Daily Lucky Wheel: Log in every day to spin the Lucky Wheel receive special daily rewards and bonuses.\r\n\u2605 Regular updates - with new levels, players, and features added all the time, there's always something new to discover.\r\n\r\nOne of the best things about Football Quiz! Ultimate Trivia is that it's the perfect game to play no matter where you are. Whether you're stuck on a long car ride or waiting for your flight at the airport, this game will keep you entertained for hours on end. And with offline play available, you can even enjoy the game when you don't have an internet connection.\r\n\r\nNot only does the game offer a wide range of difficulty levels, but it also includes a variety of categories to choose from, including players, legends, coaches, and more. This means that no matter your interests, you'll be able to find flag to guess that you're passionate about.\r\n\r\nBut don't just take our word for it - players around the world are already raving about Football Quiz! Ultimate Trivia. From its high-quality images to its wide range of difficulty levels, this game has something for everyone. In fact, it's consistently ranked as one of the top trivia games in the app store.\r\n\r\nif you're looking for even more ways to get involved, be sure to check out the game's community forums. Here, you can connect with other players, share tips and tricks, and discuss all things.\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD NOW FOR FREE\r\n\r\nSo why wait? Download Football Quiz! Ultimate Trivia today and start enjoying all the fun and excitement this football quiz trivia game has to offer. And don't forget to invite your friends to play!\r\n\r\nOverall, this game is an absolute blast to play. It's challenging and satisfying, but most of all, it's just plain fun.\r\n\r\nCompare your answers with your friends!\r\nChallenge them to see who guesses more football players!\r\n\r\nNew football players are coming soon.\r\nCheck for the updates!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.prizepoolstudios.com/privacy\r\nTerms of Service:  https://www.prizepoolstudios.com/terms",
